							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16675#msg16675"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16675#msg16675">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2769 on:</b> April 28, 2005, 04:42:33 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							#1 is always first to beat it, obviously if one guild has progressed further than another then obviously they killed x mob before the other.<br /><br />at the same time, yar&#039;lir and all of GoD (short of vish) are a joke and really nothing to compair progression on.&nbsp; if you guys beat vish before da/eie then i&#039;d say your #1, but untill then you&#039;re not.<br /><br />you&#039;re not even in anguish if im not mistaken?
