				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=420" title="View the profile of Tiiden">Tiiden</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Officer<br />
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 113<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.convictioneq.com/images/beware.gif" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								The Last of the Magicians!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=420"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.convictioneq.com" title="Conviction" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16676#msg16676"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16676#msg16676">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2770 on:</b> April 28, 2005, 05:12:10 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							No, we are not in Anguish, as we have yet to seriously attempt any PG trials.&nbsp; We used to try them on and off but realized we weren&#039;t going to get very far with our gear level, so we choose to push for Qvic and then sorta just ran with GoD progression for awhile.&nbsp; I made the post about being #1 in DoN progression before I had heard that the alliance killed it (was about 40 or so minutes later).&nbsp; <br /><br />While DoN progression has been pretty easy, I wouldn&#039;t exactly call all of GoD a joke - the encounters in Ink&#039;tuta and Txevu can still take a while to figure out, and some are still pretty hard.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=370607" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.geocities.com/tiideneq/tiidensig.jpg" alt="" border="0" /></a><br />70 Magician, Officer of&nbsp; <a href="http://www.convictioneq.com/" target="_blank">&lt;Conviction&gt;</a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
