								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16682#msg16682"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16682#msg16682">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2773 on:</b> April 29, 2005, 08:09:31 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16666#msg16666">Quote from: simplee on April 28, 2005, 09:44:48 am</a></div><div class="quote"><br />I was under the impression that the first guild to a certain point in content was the #1 in progression... did the rules change?&nbsp; First no longer equals #1 in progression?<br /></div><br />That quite possibly is the gayest attempt at trying to claim #1 I have ever seen.&nbsp; If you honestly believe you are in the #1 spot now...&nbsp; grow some balls and actually say it.&nbsp; Don&#039;t hide behind the word progression, either you&#039;ree better or you&#039;re not.<br /><br />I have no clue what the current difficulty level is of encounters but I&#039;m quite sure the current guilds do, and if this toastie guy actually knows what he&#039;s talking about you are even more pathetic.<br /><br />As much of a slime as he was, I&#039;m pretty sure even Eelyen had balls (there was webcam verification I&#039;m told)
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
