	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16684"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=146" title="View the profile of simplee">simplee</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 221<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/devil1.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								smoked again................    ranger down!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=146"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16684#msg16684"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16684#msg16684">Re: And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2774 on:</b> April 29, 2005, 10:17:48 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16682#msg16682">Quote from: Shrek on April 29, 2005, 08:09:31 am</a></div><div class="quote"><div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16666#msg16666">Quote from: simplee on April 28, 2005, 09:44:48 am</a></div><div class="quote"><br />I was under the impression that the first guild to a certain point in content was the #1 in progression... did the rules change?  First no longer equals #1 in progression?<br /></div><br />That quite possibly is the gayest attempt at trying to claim #1 I have ever seen.  If you honestly believe you are in the #1 spot now...  grow some balls and actually say it.  Don&#039;t hide behind the word progression, either you&#039;ree better or you&#039;re not.<br /></div><br />*sigh*  Let&#039;s try Reading Comprehension 101.<br /><br />I was never trying to claim the #1 spot on the server.  The original quote from Aaric (that I was responding to) was:<br /><br /><div class="quoteheader">Quote from: Aaric</div><div class="quote">I would dare not say you&#039;re #1 in progression in DoN though, you just beat us on Yar&#039;Lir run today by 15 minutes.</div><br />Progression is linear.  There are no side steps.  Saying you killed mob X or mob Y that do nothing in the way of progression doesn&#039;t put you further ahead of someone else <b>when referring to progression</b>.  For example, killing Mindrider, or even Ancient Cragbeast Matriarch is nice, but it in no way affects progression.<br /><br />When it comes to DoN and progression, the simple fact is, Yar&#039;Lir is a part of progression, and Conviction beat the encounter first.  So, for the time being, we were ahead in Progression in DoN.  Look at other servers... this is nothing new.  In several cases it wasn&#039;t the &quot;top&quot; guild or guilds that excelled in progression in DoN.  It doesn&#039;t make them the top guild on the server, but it does put them first in progression.<br /><br />Now that The Nest is open to everyone on the server, it&#039;s anyone&#039;s game.  I think DA and EiE were in there last night... they could be ahead of us today, tomorrow, or next week.<br /><br />And for the record, no, I don&#039;t have balls, nor do I have any plans to grow them... however, I don&#039;t hide behind fake names.  My game name (and gender...) are on the left of my post.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
